{"name":"Tuk Tuk","hex":"#573b2a","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"tuk tuk","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Alternative spelling of tuk-tuk."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/tuk_tuk"}],"entries":[{"title":"Tuk Tuk (film)","blocks":[{"text":"Tuk Tuk is a 2025 Indian Telugu-language supernatural comedy film written and directed by Supreeth C Krishna, produced by Rahul Reddy D, Lokku Sri Varun, C Sree Ramulu Reddy under the banners of Chitravaahani Productions and RYG Cinemas The film features Harsh Roshan, Karthikeya Dev, Madhu Sudhan Rapeti, Saanve Megghana and Nihal Kodhaty in important roles."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/f/fa/Tuk_Tuk_film_poster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tuk_Tuk_(film)","wikidata":"Q133573212"},{"title":"Auto rickshaw","blocks":[{"text":"An auto rickshaw is a motorized version of the pulled rickshaw or cycle rickshaw. Often called a tuk tuk, it is usually a three-wheeled vehicle, powered by an engine. They use a variety of fuels, with the most common being petrol, compressed natural gas, liquefied petroleum gas, and electricity. They are known by many names across many different countries."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/49/Bajaj_auto-rickshaw_in_Sri_Lanka.jpg/330px-Bajaj_auto-rickshaw_in_Sri_Lanka.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Auto_rickshaw","wikidata":"Q59720"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c8/Lambretta_FD_%282017-06-25_Sp%29.jpg/500px-Lambretta_FD_%282017-06-25_Sp%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c8/Lambretta_FD_%282017-06-25_Sp%29.jpg/1280px-Lambretta_FD_%282017-06-25_Sp%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign